    </div>
  </nav>
  <div class="content">
    <p class="eyebrow">Field health system · Nepal</p>
    <h1>A system that <em>remembers</em>,<br>so health workers don’t have to.</h1>
    <p class="lede"><strong>Sangini</strong> helps FCHVs record patient visits, track pregnancies, manage vaccination schedules, and access maternal health protocols through simple voice conversations, even without internet access.</p>
    <div class="buttons">
      <a class="btn primary" href="#demo"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M1 0l11 6-11 6z"/></svg>Watch the working prototype</a>
